# The rectangle of sweep_cubic.tlspr swept along the cubic of its 3d
# sketch, picked with the mouse, twisted by 90 degrees typed in and its
# frames held to x; the same as path_sweep_cubic.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/sweep_cubic).
file $testdata/ui/sweep_cubic.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
click-entity 40000
menu Features|Sweep Along Path
click-tw #2 [change]
edit 90
click-tw held to x
